Package: fars
Title: Read, Summarise and Map Fatality Analysis Reporting System (FARS) Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Enrique", "Pérez Herrero", email = "eph.project1500@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads the yearly accident files of the US National Highway
    Traffic Safety Administration's Fatality Analysis Reporting System (FARS),
    counts the accidents by month and year and maps the accidents of a state.
    Ships the files of 2013, 2014 and 2015. First written for the Coursera
    course "Building R Packages" (2017).
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/EnriquePH/FARS
BugReports: https://github.com/EnriquePH/FARS/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    graphics,
    maps,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyr (>= 1.0.0),
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
